# Vendored third-party bundles: generated by wallpaper/scripts/fetch-vendor.sh, never
# committed. 24MB of MediaPipe wasm/tflite already lives in public/vendor/, and a
# second copy once got swept in by a `git add -A` in a worktree where that script had
# run — 24MB every clone paid for, referenced by nothing, and invisible to the tests.
# The script rebuilds it from public/vendor/ offline, so nothing is lost by ignoring it.
wallpaper/src/vendor/
